WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:02,860
Okay, save it for her first

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,500
Anyway, it’s safest to leave it here

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:10,510
After listening to Zhuang Yan’s suggestion

4
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:11,750
Come and visit the base area

5
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:12,950
I didn't expect it to be so lively

6
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,910
Yes, it’s really nice here, Sister Shen.

7
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,430
Don't worry, Momo is home alone. She's asleep.

8
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,750
Won't wake up for two hours

9
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:20,150
Even if I wake up, I will play by myself

10
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:23,270
I'll go shopping for a while and then go back. Let's celebrate the New Year soon.

11
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:24,390
See if there's anything good

12
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,800
I've never seen what these things you bought are

13
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,760
All are useful materials

14
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,560
If you encounter it, just change it first, maybe it will be useful later.

15
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,240
Bread machine and automatic frying machine

16
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,640
I'll change a few when I come back after shopping.

17
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:41,670
A pair of spring lotuses requires half a catty of grain. Isn’t it too expensive?

18
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,910
I wrote them all myself

19
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,310
It’s Chinese New Year, let’s paint it festively

20
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,780
Vice President of the Calligraphy and Painting Association placed in front of Mo Shi

21
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,860
His pride is not cheap

22
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,420
Now we can only set up a stall to exchange food.
